 "check": {
  "describe": "Phone: Today, a big blue ring reading 1,640, of 2,000 kcal, 360 left, then three bars. Landscape and 4x2: ring left, bars right. 2x2 and round: ring alone. eaten 2600: a red second lap over a dimmed blue ring and 600 over; in mono a cut line in the white ring. protein 140: a +25 and a marked excess on the bar. The sample macros add up: 200 g carbs, 102 g protein and 48 g fat are 1,640 kcal at 4, 4 and 9 kcal per gram, and the goals make 2,000. A long day ends in an ellipsis before Calories.",
